# =============================================================================
# Editframe Rhode Demo — Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in any keys you need.
# NONE ARE REQUIRED to render this demo — Editframe runs fully local against the
# React composition (`npm run render`). The keys below are optional, listed only
# in case you extend the template.
# =============================================================================

# Editframe Cloud (only needed if you push renders to the Editframe cloud
# instead of rendering locally with `npm run render`).
# Get yours at https://editframe.com/dashboard
# EDITFRAME_API_KEY=

# fal.ai (only needed if you regenerate product/lifestyle imagery or end-card art
# at build time. Not used by the default pipeline — assets are already baked in.)
# Get yours at https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys
# FAL_KEY=
